   </body>
   </html>
   ```

5. **Configure `package.json`**:
   Modify your `package.json` file to specify the entry point of your application. Add a "main" field to indicate that `main.js` is the starting point. Also, add a start script to easily run your application:

   ```json
   {
     "name": "hello-world-electron",
     "version": "1.0.0",
     "main": "main.js",
     "scripts": {
       "start": "electron ."
     },
     "devDependencies": {
